    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "See, his limited, narrow view of the world made him feel threatened by the existence of two hard work and highly educated, successful people who happen to be black. I want to know. I want to know. Who's going to tell him that the job he's currently seeking might just be one of those black jobs?",
