    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51298.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Well, after describing himself as the only person stupid enough to speak after Michelle Obama, Barack, the former president, paid tribute to Joe Biden, his vice president for four years, before turning his attention to America's wannabe comeback kid.",
