    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Well, as well as hearing from Bill Clinton later, the convention will be addressed by Tim Walsh, the Democratic nominee for Vice President. I've been speaking to Congresswoman Dina Titus from Nevada, who's a friend.",
