    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think he's great. I served with him on the Veterans Affairs Committee for several terms in the house, and he's just every man. He wears a flannel shirt. He's got a dog and a cat. He coached football. He can speak the truth and speak it in a plain way that people understand. I think he adds a lot to the ticket, and he's already shown how popular he is. with some of the comments he's made that speeches around the country.",
