      },
      {
        "text": "Being relatable through everyday habits like wearing a flannel shirt and having pets strengthens credibility.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Popularity demonstrated by public reactions to speeches indicates broad appeal.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Coaching football implies leadership and community involvement.",
