    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/1/51298.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "He's a gun owner. He did very well for the National Rifle Association Ratings when he was in Congress. That is these days pretty unusual in the Democratic Party for somebody who was actually in the National Legislature. Is that a valuable weapon if I can put it like that in campaigning?",
