    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "And as governor, and so he knows what it's like out on the hustings. And it's good to have somebody from the house in the White House, because usually they're more connected to the Senate. And he understands how the house works. And I think we'll be a great liaison between us and the president.",
