    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "Are you nervous about November? The reason I asked this is that we have examples in 2000 and again in 2016 where a Democrat won the popular vote but lost in the Electoral College. And the path for a would-be President Kamala Harris looks even narrower than it did for Al Gore and Hillary Clinton when they failed to win.",
