    "turn_text": "Well, I'm always nervous. You know, I follow the principle that you either run unopposed or you run scared and that is certainly true in Nevada. We're a swing state. The elections are always close. We'll fight to the last day for the last vote. I think we're going to win. The map has certainly changed. The poll numbers have changed and I'm optimistic. What concerns me is if Donald Trump loses, what will he do afterwards? He said, look for a bloodbath, and we've got to worry about how he's going to challenge the Democratic exchange of power.",
