    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "The scheme that brought her and the others to Scotland was set up by John and Lorna Norgrove, who established a trust. In memory of their daughter Linda, a charity worker, kidnapped in Afghanistan in 2010. Linda was killed during a US Special Forces raid which was trying to free her. John Norgrove spoke two news hours, Tim Franks, about how the scheme to bring the women here began.",
