    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, well that's an interesting question because I thought that when they came here that the chance of qualifying with a degree in Scotland as a doctor and then working in the NHS would be really attractive for opposition. But the ones I've spoken to have all said that if there's the opportunity to return to Afghanistan, they would like to do that.",
