    "turn_idx": 59,
    "turn_text": "And of course, I'm speaking to you, John, because this is a foundation that you set up in the memory of your daughter, Linda, who was killed 14 years ago now in Afghanistan, where she was trying to help people less fortunate. She was an aid worker. It's meaningful work for what you're doing, but it must have an extra depth of meaning for you because you're doing it in the name of your daughter.",
